{"id":"487f4ba08fcc83c7","group":"88","path":"88/88-fact-ce-recursive-sigma1.md","title":"fact-ce-recursive-sigma1 — CE Sets are Sigma1","display":"fact-ce-recursive-sigma1 — CE Sets are Sigma1","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-fact-ce-recursive-sigma1","aliases":["88-fact-ce-recursive-sigma1"],"display":"fact-ce-recursive-sigma1 — CE Sets are Sigma1","depends_on":["[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-fact-ce-recursive-sigma1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-fact-ce-recursive-sigma1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-ce-recursive-sigma1 — CE Sets are Sigma1"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c78101abe1090034\" href=\"?note=c78101abe1090034\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (set of natural numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span> (first arithmetical-hierarchy level)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> (computably-enumerable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}ce\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}sigma1} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\in\\Sigma_1^0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}ce\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}sigma1} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\in\\Sigma_1^0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>c.e. 集恰是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span>集合；上标<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>表明这里是算术层级而非解析层级。</li>\n<li>算术层级的基本等价</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"c78101abe1090034","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}(A)$ (computably-enumerable predicate, see [[88-df-ce-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}ce\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}sigma1} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\in\\Sigma_1^0","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^0","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":806,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["b283fc95a9b1376d","c78101abe1090034"]}